{"script":"sj_005_02","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":280,"y":-297,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1b","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":280,"transTime":300,"y":-297,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara005_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]不如说，有些太舒服了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]这个营地也太奇怪了吧，只要住进来就不想离开了，就好像会吃人一样。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]“不要靠近那只红发野猫的营地，据说她的营地会吃人！不小心进入营地的人，最终没有一个能出来的！”[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]大概这个感觉吧。你们这么擅长结交朋友，说不定再过个不多久的时间，驿站附近就会有这种传言了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]不过，你们这里待着确实舒服，我已经开始不想回去上班了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]工作外闲下来的时间，我还想多来你们这里待一待，可以吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]你说，我是很有能力的侍者，要是能指导你做些清理工作，大家会更开心？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara005_1_face_chara005_1g","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]这有什么不行的。干脆别说什么指导了，我直接来帮忙就好了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"茜塔","text":"[show]嗯？你担心那又成加班了，我会不高兴？这是我自己想做的事，可不算什么加班。就这么说定啦！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"茜塔-在这里住的还舒服吗？"}